{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>BIGBANG團員大聲日前被拍到，與Kara成員齡智去看Mamamoo演唱會，兩人的互動看起有點親密，因此兩人戀愛的傳聞在網上瘋傳，對此大聲的經紀公司回應否認。</p><p>6月20日大聲、齡智和Oh My Girl成員效定一同去看Mamamoo演唱會，在場的網友拍到大聲與齡智緊靠在一起拿著Mamamoo應援棒討論，照片曝光後立刻引發網友熱議，也傳出兩人戀愛中。</p><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG大聲與Kara齡智被網友拍到現身Mamamoo演唱會。（網絡圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145754079872421888039486.png/Q-_I5F8CjWgIt0i1OInEZwP6a00HHDAMp2z1dads9XU\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG大聲與Kara齡智被網友拍到現身Mamamoo演唱會。（網絡圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>更多BIGBANG大聲的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145755312041496576930647.jpeg/SZFIZ8OnUFCu_y96CD930rTSTt3P_j9M2gwKa9oMCms\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145755314558210048304982.jpeg/L8TYq8yqdpff9NqWLP1vlPRFrPkkwzRmzGKTSMxik0g\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145755316718407680806495.jpeg/U96ScxEFmQGJ3aoDKUQ-cWkd5DUJCphzVE4Z_FROGfw\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145755318954102784485312.jpeg/qtfCODq4kBs9v-txm9y3Ij10JuJR8ReA1KKJg9SiiYM\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145755321328209920806132.jpeg/lsGGbVZsWBu9uYE_Qv8y5esajkGM8s93IGId_iBiHf4\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145755311521402880921506.jpeg/10J2py9Ly5fgLDVjhMksARv8EI3MWrw16XRgtel0YLU\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145755313769680896026345.jpeg/DWoBMruycPE_kcWJeg46vQNo3TmYGOUU4RkjXeEZI10\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145755315770494976712498.jpeg/90PV5yAuEbNxp8HiniXX4gd2GhfRAI2UuV9QM7lfUDM\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145755318119436288309721.jpeg/ro4IhV7Tu7n9BGqdrWIiKvoGfFXTa5hPaGxu3Ghsbtw\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145755320292216832862150.jpeg/Es9cgRVAAXO8M3VsG92CS4y-J2eN-6NU-9rIoPvayKA\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145755307020914688862345.jpeg/50r6HhFU2vG7yZhL0XYxWsPd7N5_3Qm8g8utX4PLrV8\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145755309290164224567138.jpeg/Ydh4I5XKNXYBcSFpLjisz69iD61g8cxaR0Iz7EdCM-w\"/><figcaption>BIGBANG成員姜大聲（Instagram@d_lable_official）</figcaption></figure><p>大聲的經紀公司R&amp;D Company於6月22日回應，大聲與齡智因為網絡節目《家大聲》而熟識，一起去看了Mamamoo演唱會，兩人只是關係很好的同事，戀愛傳聞並非事實。</p><p>更多Kara成員齡智的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"Kara成員齡智（Instagram@young_g_hur）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260622/1145756298311110656761382.jpeg/4Q